# Pulse hosting

Pulse lives in `C:\Users\MatthiasLavenant\Documents\command-dashboard-portable\unified` (sibling of this repo).

**Never deploy this repo (`rdg-dj-dashboard`) to Cloudflare project `pulse`.** That project is Pulse only. Deploying the DJ Dashboard there overwrites https://pulse-kzs.pages.dev/ with the wrong app.

After meaningful Pulse app changes:

1. Deploy with Cloudflare Pages only — never Netlify.
2. From the `unified` folder only (not from `rdg-dj-dashboard`):
   ```
   $env:CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID = "873fdc78a335be3970c6ec62b99e7d13"
   npx --yes wrangler pages deploy . --project-name=pulse --branch=main --commit-dirty=true
   ```
3. Live URL: https://pulse-kzs.pages.dev/
4. Do not run `netlify deploy` for Pulse.
5. User data is in JSONBin / Cloudflare KV + device localStorage, not on the host.
6. After deploy, confirm the live page title is `Pulse`, not `RDG DJ Dashboard`.
